        "Description": "A Providence Order has been sent out on the two doctors in charge of Erich Soders&apos; failed operation; Nicholas Laurent and Akira Nakamura.\r\rDr. Laurent was directly responsible for the murder of Erich Soders. Due to his failure to provide a working stem cell plan for the operation, the patient died. The Doctor must die.\r\rDr. Nakamura is the Director at the GAMA hospital and is the chief responsible for the failure. The Doctor must die.",
